    "background": "You claim to be a Jedi. Actually, you're not. You've read all about the exploits of the great Jedi Knights — so much so that you don't quite realize they no longer exist. If truth be told, you're a little crazy. You've learned of the atrocities of the Empire and of Darth Vader, and have decided to leave your comfortable existence and venture forth into the galaxy on a great quest to restore the Jedi. You've read as much as you can about the Jedi training methods and their powers, and you've tried to train yourself as best you can. Everyone thinks you're crazy. They think the Jedi were legendary, that it's all a bunch of hokey pseudo-religious nonsense. But sometimes — just sometimes — you can feel the Force. Sometimes — when you're in great danger, or when things are breaking your way — you can use Jedi powers. In any event, you fight for the Rebellion and try to right individual injustices whenever you come across them. You're basically a good fellow, so who cares if you're a little touched?",
